Lt4xwVoAfCuggv0YxQuZudl71UvsaK2C5v0K541wsPO2d2ATWmLvcWd0iDTgRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHCskXIIt3R2zHplbpCtI8bQ5hV7pnAUcG_cMi3nDj9w&oe=6AF8A117"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AsL5dIt9MPkQ7kNvwFVLmaJ&_nc_oc=Ado5rkxPy5uGWkw-eR0l_mOWs7uDpCOsK5k1CvYkXQQTqFyfPfcLZ5h-tcv-OYTCfuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT1yRo0XeAKnkiQ2TOAMXRQu93b5KKUCmaPbjdK19cgdA&oe=6AF89F21"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DkIQBIie5zMQ7kNvwFhWvzX&_nc_oc=Ado4doWeBCEMT87l6CxhH3h82hfKGoj8tXFE7y6tZMGj_z5-Q4HuqF6OPvLTMOlgYZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRM4OuogtVzuTgJbiVIdc4e7nzEZ8ZO5JJkLvnw3lXOZg&oe=6AF88D57"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZSUKT5b-158Q7kNvwHL_CzH&_nc_oc=AdqpXCiF0oFlgXVeNjisLgyV30iUItS6UYmMjG1sNrISHLgapj2L94U3_s7c8wwHOuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTe4dk4rHc7IPwVEY5NvuxIobckcydQrWTPbQF0dJHShA&oe=6AF893E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jZ0xsbTim8MQ7kNvwHLcRY1&_nc_oc=Adqj9qO1kLpLZ5CtWBo97lnPfZkOHQPfJoDiOx9t9MFe2pW8AId2fn6rNBLJvSIs6XM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQuHc4JpzsuKaaVqryiar_SCl7YCFjfCEhZPaMSDcNrDw&oe=6AF8802E"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null